{"ID":"20240513083127-kxi8a6l","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083127-kxi8a6l","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083127-kxi8a6l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513160434-wwu3qyn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513160434-wwu3qyn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:500,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513160434-wwu3qyn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:332,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:336\u0026#125;","title":"207","type":"doc","updated":"20240514151551"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513160434-wwu3qyn","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1026px;","id":"20240513160434-wwu3qyn","updated":"20240514151551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：5/15/2008"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"167 C, YW"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Female"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5/15/2008"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"失眠，右手腕痛（媽媽手），右足踝一年前扭傷後外踝易痠痛，鼻塞"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"半夜2-3點會醒"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每日2次，有時3次，平常大便軟，若水喝得較少，大便就比較硬"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃或白"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"還好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"雙足："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"冷"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"月經："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"準時"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、 頭髮易掉，且掉很多"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 左脈大於右脈，緩而有力"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡紅有牙痕"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝區結構尚可，但有黑點 （肝積毒素，有損傷）；肺區有痰"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝積毒素，鼻炎"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左太淵 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 右手腕橈側痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左丘墟、左俠谿 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 右足踝膽經痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方： "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柴胡三錢、黃芩三錢、鬱金三錢、龍膽草三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 清肝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"半夏三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 除痰濕"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮附二錢、丹皮三錢、茜草三錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 舌上有牙痕表示下焦有瘀血，腹腔內子宮  卵巢有瘀血，炮附溫下焦，牡丹皮茜草活血化瘀"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"當歸二錢、川芎三錢、白芍五錢、熟地二錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 養血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炙甘草三錢  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十付"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9 → 3"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"bf B/S"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.患者曾聽西醫建議戴手套並少動以減輕手腕疼痛，一段時間後拿掉手套發覺手腕靈活度更差 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 健康的人不動會生病，不健康的人不動更會生病，所以不健康時更要運動。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.掉髮忌吃甜食，忌吃由人工精煉糖所製造出的甜點，但天然蔗糖則可；果汁要喝現榨的天然果汁而不是瓶裝果汁。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.持續半夜一點到三點鐘醒來表示肝有問題，一點醒來代表肝中有腫瘤或硬化，問題嚴重；二點醒來表示肝中有些毒素，清除即可。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.患者足冷且大便次數較多，可以用炮附，便軟用二錢，假如便稀，便可加重其劑量。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.白芍劑量加重可以清肝，並且治療足踝扭傷以及少腹活血化瘀。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}